{"title":"Signum function","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The signum function, denoted <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/5/7556e7cb401151b4178c466ac43a5b7b29e94b24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{sgn}(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"18\" />, is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/9/4c9c26ce36b5f12f0ba41f4f24d9b03bfe67cf9c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{cases} 1 &amp; \\text{for } x &gt; 0,\\\\     -1 &amp; \\text{for } x &lt; 0, \\\\ 0 &amp; \\text{for } x=0.\\end{cases}\\]\" width=\"125\" height=\"74\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Signum_function&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Properties\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The signum function is odd.</li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/5/7556e7cb401151b4178c466ac43a5b7b29e94b24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{sgn}(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"18\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/5/47586b3428815a6f0537296fb085651c0be12a9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{|x|}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"22\" height=\"39\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79c96e270e148516fb5dd4a73725d8be87c80c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"18\" />.</li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Signum_function&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018110420\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplication